 r←Test_AskString_002(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;string;⎕TRAP;okFlag
⍝ Exercise the "Create" method with a complex and valid definition. "OK" is pressed automatically.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 myGuiParms.caption←0⊃⎕XSI
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForString
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'Please enter your name:' '(Surname, first name)'
 parms.posn←50 1050
 parms.default←'George W. Bush'
 parms.length←100
 parms.maxLength←140
 parms.hasHelpBtn←1
 parms.onHelp←'#.APLGUI.TestCases.∆OnShowMsg'
 parms.validIfEmpty←0
 parms.timeout←0.1

 (okFlag string)←myGuiParms parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.AskForString''
 →T.FailsIf 0=okFlag
 →T.FailsIf string≢parms.default

 r←T._OK
